    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For 100 years, the Perito Moreno Glacier did not change much. But now, it is getting smaller faster than ever before."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The glacier used to be "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "held",
            "ref": "v-hold"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " tightly by a big rock. Now, it is slowly "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "losing contact with the rock"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This is causing more ice pieces to break off. The glacier is moving backwards "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "little by little",
            "ref": "v-little-by-little"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Scientists are watching "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "closely",
            "ref": "v-closely"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They flew over the glacier with special tools to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "measure",
            "ref": "v-measure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the ice. They also used satellites to watch it from space. They say the glacier is melting because the Earth is getting warmer. This slow change is an important "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sign",
            "ref": "v-sign"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of climate change."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Every year, many visitors come to see this beautiful glacier. It is part of a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Visitors watch big pieces of ice break off and fall into the lake below. The loud "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "crack",
            "zh": "噼啪声"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "splash",
            "zh": "泼溅声"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "exciting",
            "ref": "v-exciting"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to hear. But melting glaciers can make sea levels rise. This can cause problems for people who live near the ocean."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Glaciers like Perito Moreno are very important. They help form the land and give us fresh water. Scientists hope people will act to protect them before they are gone forever."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
